  m_Text: "In the even harmony of the odds, stood a dice controlling the vast dimensions
    of the omniverse. After balanced prosperity for thousands of years, one night
    of darkness forever tipped the odds towards evil\u2026\n\nCreatures from the
    most nefarious of worst dimensions emerged in order to shift the realm to their
    ruling. They will have to destroy the dice of life first\u2026 and you, protector,
    cannot let that happen."
